          "description": "Three distinct ages-at-heir-birth (MT 29, SP 79, LXX 179) rather than a clean two-tradition-agree pattern -- SP's 79 isn't simply MT+100 or LXX-100 done cleanly, though it sits exactly between. SP's TOTAL (148) does still match MT's total exactly, continuing the pattern from Shelah through Serug of SP preserving MT's total via a shorter years-after (69 vs MT's 119).",
